# Windows artifacts
nul

# attnroute runtime state. It must never appear in a working tree: eight team worktrees
# with a file turning up in `git status` is a file somebody commits. The hooks write to
# ~/.claude/attn_state/<project>.json instead, and these patterns exist only to catch a
# legacy file left behind by an older version.
.claude/attn_state.json
.claude/attn_state/
.claude/settings.local.json
*.attnroute.tmp

